style='font-weight:bold'>Schicht 3: Vermittlungsschicht (Network Layer)</span>]]></one:T><one:OEChildren><one:OE creationTime="2026-09-03T10:36:36.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-03T10:36:36.000Z" objectID="{DE53BBED-4823-4497-A096-30202BA0013E}{221}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt"><one:List><one:Bullet bullet="2" fontSize="11.0"/></one:List><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-style:italic'>Was passiert:</span> Kümmert sich um die logische Adressierung und das Routing der Datenpakete durch das gesamte Netzwerk, damit sie den besten Weg zum Ziel finden.]]></one:T></one:OE><one:OE creationTime="2026-09-03T10:36:36.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-03T10:36:36.000Z" objectID="{DE53BBED-4823-4497-A096-30202BA0013E}{224}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1" style="font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt"><one:List><one:Bullet bullet="2" fontSize="11.0"/></one:List><one:T><![CDATA[<span
style='font-style:italic'>Beispiele: </span><span style='font-weight:bold'>IP-Adresse</span>, <span
style='font-weight:bold'>Router</span>. <span style='font-style:italic'>(Hier arbeitet z. B. auch WireGuard, um Datenpakete weiterzuleiten!)</span>]]></one:T></one:OE></one:OEChildren></one:OE><one:OE creationTime="2026-09-03T10:36:36.000Z" lastModifiedTime="2026-09-03T10:36:36.000Z" objectID="{DE53BBED-4823-4497-A096-30202BA0013E}{228}{B0}" alignment="left" quickStyleIndex="1"><one:List><one:Bullet bullet="2" fontSize="11.0"/></one:List><one:T style="font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt"><![CDATA[<span
